## =============================
## Documentation platform (docs/)
## =============================
## docs/data/** is the committed source of truth and is NOT ignored.
## Everything below is reproducible output: regenerate it with
##   npm run docs:harvest:source && npm run docs:validate
## Committing it would create merge conflicts on every branch and, in the case of the
## branch matrix, would carry claims about other branches into branches where they are false.
docs/generated/
docs/registry/
docs/traceability/
docs/history/

# Credentials kept beside the checkout. cred.txt holds a Coolify API token; this repository is
# public, so an un-ignored file here is one `git add -A` away from being published.
cred.txt
cred*.txt
